{"ts":"2026-07-14T09:50:51.620Z","type":"quest-declared","sealed":{"doneWhen":{"probe":"scenario-harness","args":{"scenario":"external-service-manifest-contract","reportDir":"test-output/reports/external-service-manifest-contract","consecutive":3,"metric":"priority"}},"frontierMetrics":[{"probe":"scenario-harness","args":{"scenario":"external-service-manifest-contract","reportDir":"test-output/reports/external-service-manifest-contract","metric":"priority"}}],"authoringContractVersion":1,"statement":"A versioned external service manifest contract accepts deterministically normalized, digest-pinned OCI artifacts for oci_container and wasm_component runtimes, rejects native_js and runtime/media mismatches with typed errors, and leaves artifact resolution, signature verification, catalog persistence, and activation to their downstream owners.","class":"product","constraints":[{"id":"source-change-subagent-verification","statement":"If this Quest changes source code, spawn a subagent verifier before audit and git handoff, then record a Solver finding with evidence subagent:<id>."},{"id":"sealed-contract-scope","statement":"The contract owner is src/service/external-service-manifest.js, exported through src/service/index.js and proved by test/service/external-service-manifest.test.js via scripts/checks/run-external-service-manifest-contract-scenarios.js; architecture/lagrange-service-manifest.md may be aligned with the executable schema. No other production owner is in scope."},{"id":"negative-attacks","statement":"The scenario must reject external native_js and unknown runtimes, unsupported schema versions, missing or malformed sha256 digests, non-OCI packaging, unrecognized media types, and runtime/media mismatches, while accepting both external runtime kinds and ignoring unknown optional fields deterministically."},{"id":"owner-boundary","statement":"This Quest validates and normalizes manifest structure only. It must not fetch artifacts, compare resolved bytes with digests, enforce signature policy, persist catalog state, submit lifecycle mutations, or activate runtimes."},{"id":"red-on-revert-engagement","statement":"Independent verification must show the declared scenario fails when the external manifest owner is reverted or when native_js is admitted, and must verify the exact source patch plus aggregate content before checkpoint and handoff."}],"frontierIds":["external-service-manifest-contract-main"]}}
